[822.173087, "o", "\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mT\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mhe neighborhood, to our ears, seemed haunted by\u001b[K\r\u001b[5dapproaching footsteps; and what between the dead\u001b[K\r\u001b[6dbody of the captain on the parlor floor, and the thought\u001b[K\r\u001b[7dof that detestable blind beggar hovering near at hand,\r\u001b[8d"]
[822.174251, "o", "and ready to return, there were moments when, as the\r\u001b[9dsaying goes, I jumped in my skin for terror.  Something\u001b[K\r\u001b[10dmust speedily be resolved upon; and it occurred to us at\r\u001b[11dlast to go forth together and seek help in the neighbor-\r\u001b[12ding hamlet.  No sooner said than done.  Bareheaded as we\r\u001b[13dwere, we ran out at once in the gathering evening and\u001b[K\r\u001b[14dthe frosty fog.\u001b[K\r\u001b[15d\u001b[K\u001b[16d\u001b[K\u001b[17d\u001b[K\u001b[31d\u001b[K\u001b[32d\u001b[K\u001b[33d\u001b[K\u001b[35;98H\u001b[1K \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mSpeed test\r\u001b[4dT\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[35;110H"]
